{"id":"aa4237e093888607","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-tree-value-arithmetic.md","title":"树算术的外延值保持","display":"lem-tree-value-arithmetic — 树算术的外延值保持","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-tree-value-arithmetic","aliases":["72-lem-tree-value-arithmetic"],"display":"lem-tree-value-arithmetic — 树算术的外延值保持","depends_on":["[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]]","[[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]]"],"chapter":"III","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III §§2.11–2.18, print155–159/PDF167–171; local semantic correspondence","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-tree-value-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-tree-value-arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-tree-value-arithmetic — 树算术的外延值保持"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9a2f15ef4424ad4\" href=\"?note=c9a2f15ef4424ad4\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value\">72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ee59458b6acb7c90\" href=\"?note=ee59458b6acb7c90\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic\">72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III §§2.11–2.18, print155–159/PDF167–171; local semantic correspondence"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\Omega\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\Omega\\)</span>；右侧加、乘、幂是实际序数运算。幂等式另要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;v_\\Omega(\\alpha)\">\\(0&lt;v_\\Omega(\\alpha)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v_\\Omega(\\alpha\\oplus\\beta)=v_\\Omega(\\alpha)+v_\\Omega(\\beta),\\qquad\nv_\\Omega(\\alpha\\otimes\\beta)=v_\\Omega(\\alpha)\\cdot v_\\Omega(\\beta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v_\\Omega(\\alpha\\oplus\\beta)=v_\\Omega(\\alpha)+v_\\Omega(\\beta),\\qquad\nv_\\Omega(\\alpha\\otimes\\beta)=v_\\Omega(\\alpha)\\cdot v_\\Omega(\\beta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0&lt;v_\\Omega(\\alpha)\\Longrightarrow\nv_\\Omega(\\operatorname{Pow}(\\alpha,\\beta))=v_\\Omega(\\alpha)^{v_\\Omega(\\beta)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0&lt;v_\\Omega(\\alpha)\\Longrightarrow\nv_\\Omega(\\operatorname{Pow}(\\alpha,\\beta))=v_\\Omega(\\alpha)^{v_\\Omega(\\beta)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>依次对右参数的树结构归纳，后继式对应序数算术递归；极限式用固定左参数的加法、乘法以及正底数指数在极限处连续，若上确界为后继则它在原族中达到。幂必须保留正底数：取 β=L(0,1,1,…) 与 α=0，左边为 sup{1,0}=1，右边为 0^1=0。这里没有声称全部树算术满足外延相等的反向识别。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value","status":"resolved","id":"c9a2f15ef4424ad4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"ee59458b6acb7c90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"0<v_\\Omega(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"v_\\Omega(\\alpha\\oplus\\beta)=v_\\Omega(\\alpha)+v_\\Omega(\\beta),\\qquad\nv_\\Omega(\\alpha\\otimes\\beta)=v_\\Omega(\\alpha)\\cdot v_\\Omega(\\beta).","display":true},{"tex":"0<v_\\Omega(\\alpha)\\Longrightarrow\nv_\\Omega(\\operatorname{Pow}(\\alpha,\\beta))=v_\\Omega(\\alpha)^{v_\\Omega(\\beta)}.","display":true}],"bytes":1597,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-38","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增5项：[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]] · [[72-ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies]] · [[72-ex-tree-value-nonstrict]] · [[72-lem-tree-value-arithmetic]] · [[72-thm-structured-tree-value-order]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增5项：[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]] · [[72-ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies]] · [[72-ex-tree-value-nonstrict]] · [[72-lem-tree-value-arithmetic]] · [[72-thm-structured-tree-value-order]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增5项：[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]] · [[72-ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies]] · [[72-ex-tree-value-nonstrict]] · [[72-lem-tree-value-arithmetic]] · [[72-thm-structured-tree-value-order]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增5项：[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]] · [[72-ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies]] · [[72-ex-tree-value-nonstrict]] · [[7